1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
If your Downloads folder looks like an
absolute landfill right now, stop sorting
it by hand.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:16,400
We let files pile up until finding one P D
F means five minutes of scrolling. My
folder held twelve thousand nine hundred
thirty one files.

3
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:25,800
Instead, write a ten line Python script.
It reads each file extension and moves the
file into a labelled subfolder.

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:32,500
Run it once and the folder sorts itself in
seconds. It can even bin installers older
than thirty days.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,100
Schedule it to run every night and your
storage stays clean on autopilot. Follow
for Episode four.
